  "proof_limit": [
    "parent is authenticated post113_selected ffn_only with OPT-119 mixer/FFN Q8 fusion kept; OPT-117 graph path was rejected; OPT-118 lazy/overlap kept",
    "primary target is long-context decode D8192/D32768/D131040; D128/D2048/P4096 are non-target guards",
    "at most three KV cache candidates: integer block-scaled 8-bit K/V, 8-bit K + 4-bit V, and 4-bit K/V only if prior stages pass quality and show plausible savings",
    "integer 8-bit is chosen once; ds4 FP8 writes floats into a sizeof(float) raw-cache API",
    "packed bytes and scales are the authoritative cache; fused unpack into registers/shared memory; no dense shadow",
    "keep requires OPT-115 complete-request gates and a target throughput ratio lower bound >1.00 versus parent, larger than A/A noise",
    "D8192/D32768 freeze 3 warmups plus 5 interleaved AB/BA pairs and 32 decode tokens before GPU",
    "D131040 freezes 1 warmup plus 2 pairs, 32 decode tokens, capacity 131072 before GPU",
    "D128/D2048 retain 3+10 with 256 decode tokens; P4096 retains 3+10 prefill",
    "OPT-116 long-cache quality including 131040+32 and whole-prefix retrieval is required",
    "aggregate_deadline_s 7200 is a ceiling, not a skip",
    "memory-only savings cannot admit an E2E speedup keep; diagnostic kernel times cannot admit a keep",
    "select at most one full cache design; stop a precision stage on quality failure; do not loosen OPT-116"
  ]
